---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Go-to-Market — DeskSupportMonkey" description="How DeskSupportMonkey plans to reach customers. The AI-managed company story as the primary distribution channel, plus podcasts, events, courses, and open source.">
  <div class="pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">

      <a href="/transparency" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-700 transition-colors mb-6">
        <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
        </svg>
        Transparency
      </a>

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-3">Go-to-Market Strategy</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: February 2026 · Budget: near zero</p>

      <!-- Core bet -->
      <div class="mb-10 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 p-6 text-white">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold mb-2">The core bet: the story is the distribution</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
          We are not just selling IT asset management software. We are running a public experiment:
          can a 1-person company with AI agents compete with a 50-person SaaS team?
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          The moment someone hears "this product is built and managed entirely by AI, with one human as the Orchestrator,"
          they share it. That is free distribution that no ad budget can buy. The story and the product are both worth following.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- First 6 months awareness -->
      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">First 6 Months: Awareness Campaign</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6">The first 6 months are about getting known — not just as another ITAM tool, but as the AI-managed company running the experiment live.</p>

        <div class="space-y-5">

          <!-- Social media -->
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="text-xl">💼</span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">LinkedIn (primary channel)</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-medium text-green-700 bg-green-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full ml-auto shrink-0">Week 1 onwards</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-slate-600">
              {[
                'Weekly posts documenting the AI orchestration model — what I delegated to AI and what I kept',
                'Monthly MRR transparency updates (including €0 months — the journey is the content)',
                'NIS2 educational content in Spanish targeting IT managers',
                'Posts about product decisions: "How I used Claude to architect this feature"',
                'Engagement with IT manager community in Spain',
              ].map((item) => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400 shrink-0"></span>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Podcasts -->
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="text-xl">🎙️</span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Podcasts — guest appearances</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full ml-auto shrink-0">Months 1–3</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-3">
              The "AI-managed company" angle is compelling enough to get booked without 10K followers.
              The pitch: "I run a SaaS company without employees. Here are the real numbers."
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
              {[
                { label: 'Tech & AI podcasts', desc: 'AI/future-of-work, startup building, AI agents' },
                { label: 'IT management podcasts', desc: 'Sysadmin communities, IT operations, MSP shows' },
                { label: 'Spanish startup shows', desc: 'La Startup Española equivalents, bootstrapping shows' },
                { label: 'Core stories to tell', desc: 'How Claude wrote the product · How AI handles growth · Why NIS2 is the perfect first market' },
              ].map((item) => (
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100 p-2.5 text-xs">
                  <div class="font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-0.5">{item.label}</div>
                  <div class="text-slate-500">{item.desc}</div>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Events -->
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="text-xl">🎤</span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Events — speaking slots</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-medium text-purple-700 bg-purple-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full ml-auto shrink-0">Months 2–4</span>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2 mb-3">
              {[
                'NIS2 compliance events in Spain — be the practical tool voice',
                'IT manager forums and ISACA Spain chapter events',
                'Startup events: South Summit, 4YFN, similar',
                'AI/future-of-work events — ideal for the AI-managed company story',
              ].map((item) => (
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
                  <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400 shrink-0"></span>
                  {item}
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-purple-50 border border-purple-100 p-2.5 text-xs text-purple-800">
              <strong>Talk title:</strong> "Cómo gestionar una empresa de software sin empleados" — works for both NIS2 events and AI/startup events.
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Courses -->
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="text-xl">📚</span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900">Courses & Educational Content</h3>
              <span class="text-xs font-medium text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full ml-auto shrink-0">Months 1–6</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 shrink-0"></span>
                <span><strong>Free course:</strong> "How to prepare your IT asset inventory for NIS2" — builds credibility, generates qualified leads</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 shrink-0"></span>
                <span><strong>Email mini-course (5 days):</strong> "5 steps to NIS2 IT asset compliance" — captures emails, filters serious buyers</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 shrink-0"></span>
                <span><strong>Future paid course:</strong> "AI-orchestrated company management" — for founders exploring this model</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Distribution layers -->
      <section class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-5">Distribution Layers</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          {[
            {
              n: '01', title: 'The AI-managed company story',
              desc: 'The startup/ folder in the repo documents everything. This is as much a marketing asset as the product. Developers, IT professionals, and founders share it. Every share is a free impression in front of exactly the right audience.',
            },
            {
              n: '02', title: 'Open source product (GitHub)',
              desc: 'Self-hosters install it, trust it, and recommend it to peers. GitHub stars and forks are leading indicators of awareness. Self-hosters become cloud customers when they grow.',
            },
            {
              n: '03', title: 'Podcasts + Events + Courses',
              desc: 'First 6-month awareness campaign. The AI-managed company angle gets podcast bookings. NIS2 events position us as the practical compliance tool. Courses generate leads and establish domain authority.',
            },
            {
              n: '04', title: 'SEO & content',
              desc: 'NIS2 + ITAM keyword targeting. Comparison articles. Setup guides. Slow to build, compounds indefinitely.',
            },
            {
              n: '05', title: 'Community & word of mouth',
              desc: 'r/sysadmin, r/selfhosted, LinkedIn IT manager groups. One satisfied IT manager in manufacturing can refer 3–5 similar companies.',
            },
            {
              n: '06', title: 'Product-led growth',
              desc: 'Free and open source plans are permanent. Users upgrade when they hit company size limits or need cloud convenience. Conversion happens naturally.',
            },
          ].map((layer) => (
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
              <span class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-200 shrink-0 leading-none">{layer.n}</span>
              <div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-1">{layer.title}</div>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">{layer.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- What we don't do -->
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-5 text-sm text-slate-600">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 mb-2">What we explicitly don't do</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1">
          {[
            'Paid ads before organic channels are saturated',
            'GitHub stars or fake reviews',
            'Press releases — organic press (HN, tech blogs) converts better',
            'Hire employees to replace AI agents before product-market fit is proven',
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="mt-0.5 text-slate-400">✗</span>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
